    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/08ad8036749ffbf996073da3cc2b8c91.poster.avif?t=1752062597\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/08ad8036749ffbf996073da3cc2b8c91.webm?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/08ad8036749ffbf996073da3cc2b8c91.mp4?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>NOTE: THIS MINI GAME IS 1 BOSS FIGHT. THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS. <br>10 to 30 minutes fight, more with Furier difficulty or to get a S rank!</strong><br><br>Defeat The Chain to escape your jail. Fight Furi\u2019s first guardian in an ultra-fast-paced and nervous battle, in a reinvented side-scrolling mix of shoot'em up and hack'n slash. Be agile and quick, jump, shoot, dash, parry and slash. The simple controls will test your nerves: stay calm and focus to evade the blows and counter-attack at the right time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/ab5f9b30e32178cfae897a4814a2af17.poster.avif?t=1752062597\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/ab5f9b30e32178cfae897a4814a2af17.webm?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/ab5f9b30e32178cfae897a4814a2af17.mp4?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> A love letter to 8-bit games</strong>: we love retro games and wanted this demake to feel authentic! It's the Furi experience, agile and intense, reimagined in retro style. The simple controls with only three action buttons, the old-school pixel art and the catchy music from ODD will bring you back to the 90's!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> A gift to Furi's community</strong>: We reimagined Furi's first boss fight as a way to thank players for their ongoing support. If this is your first time hearing about Furi, head to Furi\u2019s page and check it out!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> A collaboration with Sylph</strong>: We were impressed with Sylph's work as a solo dev and asked him to create this demake of Furi's first boss fight. Check out his other games!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/de5ca9cdf6421bc9e1240183830430cb.poster.avif?t=1752062597\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/de5ca9cdf6421bc9e1240183830430cb.webm?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/de5ca9cdf6421bc9e1240183830430cb.mp4?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/08ad8036749ffbf996073da3cc2b8c91.poster.avif?t=1752062597\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/08ad8036749ffbf996073da3cc2b8c91.webm?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/08ad8036749ffbf996073da3cc2b8c91.mp4?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>NOTE: THIS MINI GAME IS 1 BOSS FIGHT. THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS. <br>10 to 30 minutes fight, more with Furier difficulty or to get a S rank!</strong><br><br>Defeat The Chain to escape your jail. Fight Furi\u2019s first guardian in an ultra-fast-paced and nervous battle, in a reinvented side-scrolling mix of shoot'em up and hack'n slash. Be agile and quick, jump, shoot, dash, parry and slash. The simple controls will test your nerves: stay calm and focus to evade the blows and counter-attack at the right time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/ab5f9b30e32178cfae897a4814a2af17.poster.avif?t=1752062597\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/ab5f9b30e32178cfae897a4814a2af17.webm?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/ab5f9b30e32178cfae897a4814a2af17.mp4?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> A love letter to 8-bit games</strong>: we love retro games and wanted this demake to feel authentic! It's the Furi experience, agile and intense, reimagined in retro style. The simple controls with only three action buttons, the old-school pixel art and the catchy music from ODD will bring you back to the 90's!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> A gift to Furi's community</strong>: We reimagined Furi's first boss fight as a way to thank players for their ongoing support. If this is your first time hearing about Furi, head to Furi\u2019s page and check it out!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> A collaboration with Sylph</strong>: We were impressed with Sylph's work as a solo dev and asked him to create this demake of Furi's first boss fight. Check out his other games!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/de5ca9cdf6421bc9e1240183830430cb.poster.avif?t=1752062597\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/de5ca9cdf6421bc9e1240183830430cb.webm?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593450/extras/de5ca9cdf6421bc9e1240183830430cb.mp4?t=1752062597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Fight your way free in this 8-bit-inspired version of Furi's first boss fight against The Chain. Frantic action, nervous controls, a blend of shoot and sword fight reimagined in 90s style. Only 1 boss fight! A gift to Furi\u2019s fans.",
